&+Lpropped up, along with all the others in the crypt of Shuhul
&+LIshai-Bal, to face north. The markings of the far-eastern
&+Lfamily, Ishai-Bal, can be faintly seen on top of each coffin:
&+La stylized scarab with a curved scimitar running down the
&+Lcenter of its back. The Ishai-Bal tribe, and its patriarch
&+LShuhul, were said to be the personal servants of the nobleman,
&+LEndorovich.
~
