mystical scroll favor chaplain~
                                             ___________________________
   _______________________-------------------                           `\
 /:--__                                                                  |
||< > |                                   _______________________________/
| \__/_________________-------------------                             |
|                                                                      |
 |  To the Esteemed Practitioner of the Healing Arts,                   |
  |                                                                      |
 |  From the shadowed halls of Castle Ravenloft, I, Rahadin,            |
 |  Chamberlain and faithful servant to His Excellency, Count           |
 |  Strahd von Zarovich, extend to you an invitation both rare          |
 |  and consequential.                                                  |
 |                                                                      |
 |  Your reputation has reached even these mist-enshrouded peaks-      |
  |  your skill with tinctures, draughts, and the subtle balances      |
  |  between life and decay has been noted by discerning eyes.         |
  |  His Excellency ever values those whose talents straddle           |
  |  the line between mercy and mastery. Thus, you are entreated       |
  |  to take up residence within the Castle's Apothecary, a chamber   |
 |  of both reverence and quiet dread, where few have worked..        |
 |  and fewer have endured. The laboratory lies within the eastern    |
 |  wing, its windows forever gazing into the mists of Barovia.       |
 |  There, you will find ample materials for your craft, though       |
 |  I caution: many reagents within these walls obey laws known        |
  |  only to the Dark Powers that cradle this valley.                  |
  |                                                                    |
  | Your duties will be few, but exacting. The Count desires           |
  | restoratives for the body and spirit - though the latter, as you   |
  | will discover, is a far more delicate matter in this land. You    |
  | will prepare elixirs, distillations, and perhaps, when the night  |
  | grows long and the thunder stills, you will assist in deeper      |
  | studies: the nature of vitality itself, the quiet rhythm between  |
  | death and what persists beyond it.                                |
 |                                                                   |
 | Understand this: service in Castle Ravenloft is no common employ. |
 | It is a covenant. You will find reward in abundance, for His      |
 | Excellency is a generous patron to those who serve faithfully.    |
 | Yet disloyalty, neglect, or curiosity beyond your station will    |
 | invite consequences of a kind best left undescribed.              |
 |                                                                   |
  |  Should you accept, seek my audience and inquire about the        |
  |  fortunes of Ravenloft. Procure five of such fortunes,            |
  |  along with the presentation of this letter, and you will be      |
  |  conveyed through the mists to your new home.                     |
 |                                                                   |
 |                                                                   |
 |         &+L,_  &+g`{&+r@&+g)'                       &+b/R /4 /-/ /4 /> / /\/&+L  &N   |
 |        &+L<)')-&+g//`                       &+BHigh Chamberlain Rahadin&+L     &N|
 |        &+L(_.\\=        &N                                             |
 |          &+L"&+g//&+L`&N                              _______________________|_
 |  ___________________-----------------------                         `\
 |/`--_                                                                  |
 ||[ ]||                                          ______________________/
  \===/___________________------------------------
